COMPILATION OF: E52PO

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52PO

   1 a 0000 E52PO: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E52PO (FILE route armable mirror of 115 with the DEC VAR in
   3 a 0006       place of the expression; expect 80 00 03 FF 02 03 02 05
   4 a 0006       39 56 2E 39 39 81) */
   5 a 0006    /* P3-3 file-route probes: f declared file, NO open (P086K
   6 a 0006       attaches without one, [C282]). */
   7 c 0006    dcl f file, d fixed decimal(4,2);
   8 c 0006    d = 1.5;
   9 c 0016    put file(f) skip edit('|',d)(a,p'9V.99');
  10 a 004D end E52PO;

CODE SIZE = 0050
DATA AREA = 0015
FREE SYMS = 3899
END  COMPILATION
